  "solution": "Given equation: (176 ÷ 4) + (22 × 8) − (2 × 20) = 70\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 4 and 8**\n\nGiven: (176 ÷ 4) + (22 × 8) − (2 × 20) = 70\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**176 ÷ 8**__) + (__**22 × 4**__) − (__**2 × 20**__) = 70\n\n⇒ __**22 + 88**__ − 40 = 70\n\n⇒ __**110** - 40__ ≠ 70\n\n**⇒ 70 = 70**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 2 and 4\n\nGiven: (176 ÷ 4) + (22 × 8) − (2 × 20) = 70\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**176 ÷ 2**__) + (__**22 × 8**__) − (__**4 × 20**__) = 70\n\n⇒ __**88 + 176**__ − 80 = 70\n\n⇒ __264____ – 80__ = 70\n\n⇒ 184 ≠ 70\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 22 and 20\n\nGiven: (176 ÷ 4) + (22 × 8) − (2 × 20) = 70\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**176 ÷ 4**__) + (__**20 × 8**__) − (__**2 × 22**__) = 70\n\n⇒ __**44 + 160**__ − 44 = 70\n\n⇒ __**204 – 44**__ = 70\n\n⇒ 160 ≠ 70\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 2 and 8\n\nGiven: (176 ÷ 4) + (22 × 8) − (2 × 20) = 70\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**176 ÷ 4**__) + (__**22 × 2**__) − (__**8 × 20**__) = 70\n\n⇒ __**44 + 44**__ − 160 = 70\n\n⇒ __88 – 160__ = 70\n\n⇒ -72 ≠ 70\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
